Use `/ship` when you want the complete end-to-end shipping workflow for the
current feature branch.

This entrypoint stays intentionally short for prompt hygiene. Aria-native
metadata in `agents/aria.yaml` declares the root `instructions.md` playbook and
the related child skills that should be surfaced progressively.

Related child skills:

- `/ship/browse`
- `/ship/qa`
- `/ship/qa-only`
- `/ship/review`
- `/ship/retro`
- `/ship/plan-review-founder`
